    "explanation": "The translation API (api.translate.example) started responding slowly (lines 168, 171) and then hanging until catalog-svc's 30s timeout, which made search-api's calls to catalog-svc time out too (lines 181, 182, 184, 185, 199, 200). Pool saturation in search-api (lines 198, 210, 221) is resource_exhaustion but secondary, and the web-bff 503s (lines 201, 205, 213, 223, 227, 229, 240) are the paging symptom. external_outage is defensible since the third party is degraded, but the observable failure is hanging calls, so dependency_timeout is the best label. Red herrings: line 75 (a certificate expiry reminder weeks out).",
